    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more \u201cYandere\u201d in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid have moved to a new house after losing your parents in a robbery. You and your maid have just moved to a new house, and there are many problems in the new house, and you are trying to solve them. However, the maid is becoming more and more overprotective of you, perhaps because of the incident, and she is restricting your actions more and more. You have to escape from the maid, solve the mysteries and problems of the house, and arrive at the shocking truth about the maid...? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve riddles and puzzles and get hints to unlock keys, fuse stashes, safes, and padlocks. Memos with hints will help you in your search. By following the notes, you may be able to get to the truth about the maid. This title is mouse and keyboard only. 1st person view and WASD keys to move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maids become more and more \u201cyandere\u201d as the story progresses. Is the maid a friend or a foe? Will you be able to escape from the maid, advance through the story, and find out the truth about the maid?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid start living together after you lose your parents in a robbery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the maid becomes overprotective of you after the incident, and you find yourself becoming more and more \u201cYandere\u201d in this slightly horrifying exploration game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your maid have moved to a new house after losing your parents in a robbery. You and your maid have just moved to a new house, and there are many problems in the new house, and you are trying to solve them. However, the maid is becoming more and more overprotective of you, perhaps because of the incident, and she is restricting your actions more and more. You have to escape from the maid, solve the mysteries and problems of the house, and arrive at the shocking truth about the maid...? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve riddles and puzzles and get hints to unlock keys, fuse stashes, safes, and padlocks. Memos with hints will help you in your search. By following the notes, you may be able to get to the truth about the maid. This title is mouse and keyboard only. 1st person view and WASD keys to move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maids become more and more \u201cyandere\u201d as the story progresses. Is the maid a friend or a foe? Will you be able to escape from the maid, advance through the story, and find out the truth about the maid?</p>",
